  "2026-10-30T17:40:47.675Z",codex-agent,"Additional original-head control: node --test --test-concurrency=1 --experimental-test-coverage --test-coverage-include=policy-card.ts --test-name-pattern=\"authoritative status read failures preserve\" test/policy-card.test.ts on untouched cd91de9 reports 3 tests, 1 pass, 2 failed nodes (the typed subtest and its parent). Native read failures pass, but the typed path returns backend_unavailable where the test expects provenance_read_retryable at line 1339. The current integration attempt has the same failing test. Preserve original backend errors and reconcile the intended public refusal contract; this case is outside the seven requested fixes."
